  "scope": "The native basic source constructs the body-to-stable-member matrix from arbitrary raw source trig pairs. Four explicit phases cover first row, other row, the containing-source six-product VXV cross computation, and final source EXIT/doubling/stores through pre-SWRETURN. Ordinary destination ECADRs0400..03756 must retain an eighteen-word within-bank range and exclude the stable trig inputs. All destination banks and incoming EB contexts are exercised, including actual XNB E5,1664. The VXV proof covers this complete source composition, not a general cross-product API. Unrounded products, raw overflow/BUF/OVFIND effects and source A/BANKSET exchanges are preserved."
